# Scope Guard + Self-Learning

## Scope Enforcement

### In Scope (hackathon — locked)
Express text input · Interpret text paste · Urgency signal · English script · TTS playback ·
Mandarin → English only · Red-flag emergency card · RAG over 12 sources · Single-page web app · No login

### Hard rejections (refuse and explain why)
| Request | Rejection reason |
|---------|-----------------|
| Voice / STT input | Out of scope. Web Speech API multilingual unreliable. Demo risk. |
| OCR / photo upload | Out of scope. Separate problem. |
| Cantonese support | Out of scope. Mandarin only for hackathon. |
| User accounts / auth | Out of scope. Privacy complexity. |
| Diagnosis output | Violates Safety Rule 1. Architectural breach. |
| "It's probably fine" output | Violates Safety Rule 2. Must rewrite. |
| External vector DB (Pinecone, etc.) | Out of scope. In-memory only. |
| Analytics / tracking | Requires consent banner. Out of scope for hackathon. |
| Any feature not in docs/pathways/4-maternity.md §3 | Rejected. Update PRD first if genuinely needed. |

When rejecting: state the rule, state the PRD section, offer the in-scope alternative.

