## Cursor Model Guidance

Use Claude models (configured in Cursor model selector) for all generation tasks in this project.
This keeps the Cursor development context consistent with the production Anthropic API stack.

For Cursor chat / composer tasks:
- **Architecture decisions, review, debugging** → use the most capable model available (Opus / Sonnet)
- **Quick edits, boilerplate, type fixes** → use a faster model (Haiku / Flash equivalent)

> Note: If team wants to use "GLM 5.1" — confirm exact model ID and add as custom API provider in
> Cursor Settings → Models → Add Model. For Mandarin-heavy tasks, a Chinese-language-optimised
> model may improve explanation quality. Route Mandarin generation through that model if available.
